{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15103320","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15103320","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1510332001:0":{"text":"……那个图腾纹样……","source_cn":"……那个图腾纹样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1F2896AC92A5EC9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510332002:0":{"text":"珀尔修斯，你应该再清楚不过了，那是<style=\"highlight\">丰饶神赛图恩的神力印记</style>。那些针蝗是丰饶神的眷属。","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，你应该再清楚不过了，那是<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF624D38F941A41B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510332003:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">你是被丰饶神授予了武器的获选者</style>，那柄长枪上附有丰饶神的力量，所以你才能在战斗中屡屡得胜。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>你是被丰饶神授予了武...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2437BA0E2561D6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1510332004:0":{"text":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不会赋予信徒能够杀死自己的力量。","source_cn":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6DB88311B7A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1510332004":{"text":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不会赋予信徒能够杀死自己的力量。","source_cn":"但是，遇上同是丰饶神所创之物，它就会失去效用。神……不会赋予信徒能够杀死自己的力量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F6DB88311B7A025","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_mal